WEBVTT

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:02.266
So our next exercise is very similar to what we just did, the plank.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:06.100
We're going to add on to that and it's going to be the around the world pushups.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:06.666
So you're going to come onto your hands and knees just like you did before.

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:12.100
Wide, wide hands.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.466
Same rules apply.

00:00:15.066 --> 00:00:16.100
Extend those legs out so you're in your push up position.

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:30.266
So from here, it's going to start with that rock.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.933
You're going to rock towards the right side.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.633
Stay on that right side.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:31.766
You're going to push down.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.900
Bring your nose towards the mat.

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:32.200
Press up on the left side and all the way up.

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:32.500
So you're making a big circle so you can get all into those shoulders and get those cuts.

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:33.833
Again, left side.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:33.933
Come over.

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.166
Press down.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.466
Bring your nose to the center.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.866
Press and lift all the way up.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.900
Good again.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.266
So you're going to go around the world on the right side.

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.766
Hinge over.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.233
Good.

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:43.733
Bend down.

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:45.133
Bring your nose through the center.

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:47.266
Press up on the left side and back in.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.433
Again.

00:00:46.466 --> 00:00:48.300
Now you're going to reverse it.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.266
Bring to the left.

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:51.300
Press down all the way.

00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:53.333
Bring that nose to that mat.

00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:55.233
Press.

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:56.466
Exhale to lift.

00:00:55.566 --> 00:00:57.966
So you brought this important here.

00:00:57.066 --> 00:00:58.533
Use your breath.

00:00:57.566 --> 00:00:58.733
One more right.

00:00:57.866 --> 00:01:00.300
Down through center.

00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:02.066
Press and lift and again.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.500
And left.

00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:05.233
Down through center and down.

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:10.600
So if you're not as strong as Mark is here, you can bend your knees down and do girl pushups and do it the same exact way.

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:12.966
So keep those hips forward.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.700
Again, bend over towards the right side.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.266
Come down through center.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.500
Press up for left and lift.

00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:19.066
Still keeping the navel scooped in.

00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:22.100
Keeping the shoulders pressed away from the ears and press all the way up.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.066
Press back to child's pose.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.966
Give yourself a good stretch.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.900
Heels towards the butt.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:38.800
Our next clip will be arabesque pulls.
